[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: KM271-WiFi Hardware Architecture
UID: KM271-HWA
VERSION: 0.1
OPTIONS:
  VIEW_STYLE: Table

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: architecture.sgra

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Circuit level architecture of the KM271-WiFi main board v2.0. Each block
names the schematic designators that realize it and traces to the
hardware requirements (KM271-HW-xxx). Reference: KM217-WiFi.kicad_sch,
state of 2026-11-24.
<<<

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Power

[BLOCK]
UID: KM271-HWA-001
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: Supply input and OR-ing
DESCRIPTION: >>>
Slot 5 V (J1 pin 1) enters via R33 (0 Ohm) as VPP, is clamped by D10 and
passes D9 to +5V. USB VBUS passes D8 to +5V. C7 (220 uF polymer), C2 and 100
nF capacitors buffer +5V.
<<<
REALIZATION: R33, R34, D8, D9, D10, C7, C2, C19
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-001
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-002
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-003
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-007

[BLOCK]
UID: KM271-HWA-002
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: Step-down converter 3.3 V
DESCRIPTION: >>>
TPS62162DSG fixed 3.3 V (FB to GND) with L1 2.2 uH (cjiang FTC252012S), C28 10
uF input, C29 22 uF output, C26 100 nF. Output to +3V3 via R78. +3V3 is
buffered with C8 220 uF polymer, C13 22 uF and C14 2.2 uF.
<<<
REALIZATION: U8, L1, C26, C28, C29, R78, C8, C13, C14
VARIANTS: R78 fitted (default). Remove R78 for an external 3.3 V supply.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-004
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-005
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-006
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-007
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-009
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-082

[BLOCK]
UID: KM271-HWA-003
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: LDO alternative
DESCRIPTION: AZ1117-3.3 in SOT-223 with C4, connected to +3V3 through R79.
REALIZATION: U2, C3, C4, R79
VARIANTS: >>>
Not fitted. Fit U2, C4, R79 and remove R78 to use the LDO (only for the first
prototype comparison).
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-008

[BLOCK]
UID: KM271-HWA-004
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: 5 V monitor
DESCRIPTION: Divider R5 100 kOhm / R12 47 kOhm from +5V to GPIO4 (ADC1_CH3).
REALIZATION: R5, R12
COMMENT: Measures behind D8/D9, so the reading is 0.3-0.4 V below the source.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-010

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Logamatic interface

[BLOCK]
UID: KM271-HWA-010
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: Slot connector
DESCRIPTION: >>>
2x6 card edge contact (J1). Each pin is routed through a 0 Ohm resistor
(R33-R44) to its function.
<<<
REALIZATION: J1, R33-R44
VARIANTS: R41-R44 (pins 9-12) not fitted.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-001
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-023

[BLOCK]
UID: KM271-HWA-011
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: Serial level shifters
DESCRIPTION: >>>
Two single-gate translators SN74LV1T34. U4 (VCC 3.3 V) translates LM_TX (5 V)
to GPIO18 via R3. U5 (VCC 5 V) translates GPIO17 to LM_RX via R1. R2 pulls
LM_TX up to 5 V.
<<<
REALIZATION: U4, U5, R1, R2, R3, C9, C10
VARIANTS: >>>
R18/R31 (DNP) bypass the translators for tests. R10 (DNP) optional pull-up on
GPIO17.
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-020
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-021
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-022

[BLOCK]
UID: KM271-HWA-012
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: Exhaust gas sensor circuit
DESCRIPTION: >>>
J1-3 feeds the sensor via R17 3.3 kOhm (C11 100 nF to ATS-). The sensor
voltage goes through R11 100 kOhm and C12 33 nF to J1-7. ATS- is J1-4. J1-8 is
tied to ATS- through R32 10 kOhm. D5 clamps ATS+ when fitted.
<<<
REALIZATION: R17, R11, C11, C12, R32, D5, J5, J8, R35, R36, R39, R40
VARIANTS: D5 DNP (default). J5/J8 buyer option.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-024
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-025

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Controller

[BLOCK]
UID: KM271-HWA-020
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Component
TITLE: ESP32-S3 module
DESCRIPTION: >>>
ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N8R2 with decoupling C1 100 nF, C13/C14, EN RC (R29 10 kOhm,
C30 1 uF), IO0 pull-up R27, BOOT SW3 and RESET SW4.
<<<
REALIZATION: U1, C1, C30, R27, R29, SW3, SW4
RELATIONS:
