[[SECTION]]
TITLE: USB

[BLOCK]
UID: KM271-HWA-030
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: USB front end
DESCRIPTION: >>>
Signal path J2 -> R69/R70 (2.2 Ohm) -> over the pads of U3 (SRV05-4) ->
JP1/JP2. Shield to GND via R60 22 Ohm. VBUS to D8.
<<<
REALIZATION: J2, R69, R70, U3, R60, JP1, JP2
VARIANTS: JP1/JP2 bridged 1-2 (default): ESP32-S3 USB. Bridged 2-3: CP2102N.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-034
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-035
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-036
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-037

[BLOCK]
UID: KM271-HWA-031
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: USB-UART bridge with auto-reset
DESCRIPTION: >>>
CP2102N in QFN-28, VREGIN and VDD on +3V3, VBUS sense R71 22 kOhm / R72 47
kOhm, RSTb pull-up R73 1 kOhm, C5 4.7 uF. TXD/RXD to UART0 via R76/R77 220
Ohm. DTR/RTS drive Q1/Q2 (R82, R84-R86) for EN/IO0. D6/D7 show traffic.
<<<
REALIZATION: U10, R71-R77, C5, C18, C20, C21, Q1, Q2, R82, R84-R86, D6, D7
VARIANTS: Can stay unpopulated when only the native USB path is used.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-038
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-039
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: KM271-HW-040

