[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Sensor inputs and extension

[BLOCK]
UID: KM271-HWA-040
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: Sensor terminal circuits
DESCRIPTION: >>>
J6 inputs 2/4/6 via R9/R8/R7 to ADC1_CH7/CH6/CH5 with C15-C17 100 nF to GND,
pull-ups R50-R52 and pull-downs R13-R16 positions. Pull-up rail R49-Pad2 is
fed from +3V3 via R57 (or from GPIO5 via R53). OneWire from GPIO15 via R6 to
J6-8 with R49 1 kOhm. +3V3 and +5V via R65/R64.
<<<
REALIZATION: J6, R6-R9, R13-R16, R49-R53, R57, R64, R65, C15-C17
VARIANTS: >>>
Default: R16 pull-down (oil meter on pin 2), R50/R51 1 kOhm pull-up on pins
6/4, R52 and R13-R15 DNP.
<<<
RELATIONS:
