[BLOCK]
UID: KM271-HWA-041
STATUS: Draft
KIND: Circuit
TITLE: Extension header circuit
DESCRIPTION: >>>
J7 2x5 SMD header. SPI via R45-R48 22 Ohm, I2C via R54/R55 22 Ohm directly
from GPIO9/GPIO16 with pull-ups R4/R30, nINT via R56 with pull-up R63 4.7
kOhm.
<<<
REALIZATION: J7, R4, R30, R45-R48, R54-R56, R63
